  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> be the solution curve of the differential equation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to</p>",
